      "rationale": "The paper supports reuse mainly as a transferable preliminary-design method around Nanospace, scripts, SysML-to-DSM transformation, and dependency/parameter abstractions. The CREME demonstration is still a specific use case, so mission-agnostic architecture should not be coded. v1.1 labels are supported because the model is high-level, parameter/interface/dependency-focused, and deliberately omits detailed behavior/modes/domains, while claiming the diagrams can be reshaped for new missions.",
